Void Siphon sprite
------------------

Files:   data/art/part_rod_infernal.png
         data/art/part_rod_obsidian.png
         data/art/artifact_bound_crystal.png
         src/main/resources/assets/voidworks/textures/item/void_siphon.png
Author:  Malcolm Riley
Source:  https://github.com/malcolmriley/unused-textures
